title: Deprecate `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase`
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase` is deprecated and will be removed after May 2027. Use `pallet-staking-async` with `pallet-election-provider-multi-block` instead.

    A runtime that removes the pallet must clear its storage, for example with `frame_support::migrations::RemovePallet`.
crates:
- name: pallet-election-provider-multi-phase
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-runtime-common
  bump: minor
